The prompts, agent skill definitions, workflow texts, venue briefs, LaTeX templates, validation and evidence
scripts, and the circle-packing examples in this distribution are taken or adapted from that project. Every
modification to a prompt or skill is declared in src/langgraph_agentic_scientist/prompts/changes/ and summarised in
docs/ADAPTATIONS.md. The unmodified upstream files are included under third_party/ai-scientist-v3/.

The upstream project ships no NOTICE file. It redistributes third-party LaTeX style and bibliography-style files,
which this distribution carries unchanged and which keep their own notices:

- third_party/ai-scientist-v3/src/agents/skills/write-paper/templates/iclr/paper.sty (and the copy staged with the
  write-paper skill): ICLR macros adapted by Hugo Larochelle from the NIPS style file.
- third_party/ai-scientist-v3/src/agents/skills/write-paper/templates/iclr/paper.bst (and the copy staged with the
